<h1>Browser tools</h1>

<h2><a href="./countdownNumbers">Countdown Numbers</a></h2>
<p>Brute force, unoptimized Countdown numbers solver.</p>
<p>It checks all combinations of numbers and operations, rather than taking advantage of prime factorisations shortcuts which are effective for large numbers used in a Beltmatic Factory generator.</p>

<h2><a href="./cutCalculator">Cut Calculator</a></h2>
<p>Based off CellBlocks solver, a cut caculator which can split a defined area into the requried sections.</p>
<p>Has a kerf margin built in, to allow it to be used for planning sheet material cuts.</p>

@* <h2><a href="./ImageEditRotator">Image Edit Rotator</a></h2>
<p>Canvas drawing pad which rotates and mirrors the live drawing, used to understand symmetry and create ambigrams.</p> *@

@* <h2><a href="./MdViewer">Markdown Viewer</a></h2>
<p>Text pad which instant renders Markdown.</p> *@

